{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49776","headline":"浣溪沙 五 · 张泌","name":"浣溪沙 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翡翠屏开绣幄红，谢娥无力晓妆慵，锦帷鸳被宿香浓。\n微雨小庭春寂寞，燕飞莺语隔帘栊，杏花凝恨倚东风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张泌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49776.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49776","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}